# ACCURATE — Create an agent with --agents flag (real Claude Code CLI)
# Sim self-drives: streams the real command character-by-character, then the
# pre-captured response from a real claude --agents API call.
# Target: ~30s

Output accurate-create-agent-demo.mp4

Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1280
Set Height 720
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 28

Hide
Type "node /Users/chadhendren/Desktop/claude-skills-demo/accurate-create-agent-sim.js"
Enter
Sleep 600ms
Show

# Sim fully self-driven — just wait for it to complete
# Runtime measured at ~12.4s + typing animation ~5s = ~18s; hold remainder
Sleep 22s

Sleep 9.2s
